+# Retained development and checking scope
+
+The original cubic producer was replayed with its unchanged complete receipt.
+The new fourth coefficient is generated by the original K/Gamma recursion and
+finite Casimir inverse polynomial. The separate differential audit uses direct
+quaternion generator insertions, rather than the producer's Fierz contractions.
+All 78 representatives are checked at two specified rational assignments. The
+intertwining identities in Q4-Q11 are the written all-coordinate argument; the
+finite point evaluations do not replace that argument.
+
+The sixth-energy check uses a different, linear-eigenvector recurrence, while
+sharing the exact trace presentation and Haar integration engine. The cube has
+an additional independent geometric denominator sum over all 720 face orders.
+No claim of independent external review is made.
+
+An early direct second-order jet implementation exceeded the execution-service
+envelope. The final generator-insertion audit evaluates the same original
