+intermediate guard was corrected to 1.53529. The later full quartic-reference
+result has its own strictly larger domain and exact margins in R26-R32.
+
+Two combined final replay harness calls exceeded the execution-service envelope.
+The runner was given a stage selector without changing any proof or test. The
+four final stage executions, both fresh-copy modes and fourteen intended CLI
+corruption rejections completed with recorded exits. No incomplete execution is
+recorded as successful. The two intermediate receipt hashes preceding the final
+runner/source changes are historical development data and are not the final
+certificate identity.
+
+The GitHub read confirmed PR8 at 91434b6962062bd80439d4cb2cae9d2479264dde. The
+available connector actions exposed no create/write operation, and no configured
