+* cyclic trace rotation;
+* reversal of the entire word with every sign reversed, since tr(V^(-1))=tr(V) for V in SU(2);
+* tr(V^r)=P_r(tr V), where P_0=2, P_1=x, P_r=x P_(r-1)-P_(r-2).
